  "summary": "I'm a junior level developer with a background in retail, food-service, and most recently logistics. I've often risen to a position of leadership within these fields which has given me practice at meeting deadlines, coordinating groups of varying size, and implementing strategies to accomplish both personal and shared goals.\n\nWhile I'm grateful for the opportunities and knowledge these positions have afforded me, none of these fields have satisfied my desire to create. After exploring my options within the tech industry I settled on web design and have gone through Centriq Training's course. Since that decision my passion for the field has only grown and I often volunteer to help with outreach programs such as CoderDojoKC.  I relish in the chance to face new challenges, overcome obstacles, and solve problems in innovative and unique ways. \n\nIf you, or anyone you know, have any opportunities and/or openings that I would be a good fit for please reach out to me here on LinkedIn or at my email caileanqwilliams@outlook.com!",
